Thank you again for your thoughtful and constructive comments. We would like to kindly bring your attention to our detailed responses in the rebuttal, where we have addressed each of your concerns point-by-point and provided substantial additional experiments, including:

- Controlled disagreement analyses and clarifications on the annotation protocol;
- Release plans for the benchmark, RM training data, and RL training data;
- Ablation studies across multiple editors, RL methods (including TempFlow-GRPO), and OOD stress tests;
- A comprehensive efficiency–performance analysis for the self-ensemble strategy;
- Additional discussions and future directions regarding reward variance.

**We sincerely hope that these updates resolve your concerns. If our clarifications and new experiments satisfactorily address the questions you raised, we would greatly appreciate your consideration for a higher score.**

Thank you very much for your time and constructive feedback.
